Hello,

I forgot to add that I don't find your


unlist(agg[2], use.names = FALSE)


the best way, `[` extracts a sub-data.frame, use `[[` instead.


unlist(agg[[2]], use.names = FALSE)


It may not make a difference, followed by unlist the results might be
the same but it is conceptually better to extract the column, to use
`[[`. See the difference between the two:


str(agg[2])
str(agg[[2]])


Hope this helps,
Rui Barradas

